@startuml ai-sandbox
!include _theme.puml

title AI assistants, kept in a room of their own

rectangle "The sandbox (bubblewrap jail)" as jail #FDE9E8 {
  component "AI assistant\nClaude Code · Gemini CLI ·\nOpenCode · local Ollama" as ai
  component "The project\nyou are working on" as project #E6F4F4
}

component "Your SSH agent\nand keys" as ssh #F5F5F2
component "The rest of\nyour home directory" as home #F5F5F2

ai --> project : can read and write

ai -[#CC0403,dashed]-> ssh : blocked
ai -[#CC0403,dashed]-> home : blocked

note bottom of jail
  The assistant runs your project's code on
  your behalf. Should it misbehave, the jail
  walls it off from the keys to your other
  machines and the rest of your files. You
  get the help without handing over
  everything.
end note
@enduml
